coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder stop [flags] <workspace>

  Stop a workspace

OPTIONS:
      --log-buffer-size int, $CODER_LOG_BUFFER_SIZE (default: 1000)
          Number of debug log entries to keep in memory and write to the session
          log file if the command fails. Set to 0 to disable buffering. Ignored
          with --verbose, which writes debug logs unconditionally.

      --log-dir string, $CODER_LOG_DIR
          Directory to write session diagnostic log files to. Defaults to the
          user state directory.

  -y, --yes bool
          Bypass confirmation prompts.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
